hush boys you'll see you'll see first we must go back to the house where i

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:14.710
worked as a young housemaid for a certain

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:20.070
dr henry jekyll one of the finest men in all of england

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:26.120
as i remember it was his birthday well henry

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:30.000
a very happy birthday indeed and your future may it

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.300
even more prosperous and successful.

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:34.290
To Henry, to Henry.

