00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:03.930
- My dear Jekyll, you're with trusted friends here.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:06.820
Not a word of what you tell us will escape this room.

00:04:06.820 --> 00:04:09.160
- Oh, do tell us, Henry.

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:12.240
