You're a lucky man, Jekyll. A good doctor, born rich, wanting for nothing, able to help the sick and the poor.

00:07:21.010 --> 00:07:30.000
At last, on the brink of a discovery that will astound the world. If this experiment works, I will have separated

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:37.520
